---
/** How this site works: the v1 architecture (docs/architecture.md) as a live graph. */
---

<section class="sec chapter" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <h2 id="how-h" data-split>
        How this site works
      </h2>
      <p>
        Static pages on Vercel, a small API Worker on Cloudflare with D1, and a separate chat
        Worker. Nothing runs that doesn't need to.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="graph" data-graph>
      <svg
        class="g-d"
        viewBox="0 0 1200 430"
        role="img"
        aria-label="Architecture: the visitor's browser loads static pages from Vercel and calls the portfo-api Worker for contact, views and GitHub; the Worker uses D1 and Resend; a Cron Trigger syncs GitHub; chat is a separate portfo-chat Worker with Vectorize."
      >
        <path class="e" id="e1" d="M190 210 C230 210 230 90 270 90"></path>
        <path class="e" id="e2" d="M190 220 C230 220 230 245 270 245"></path>
        <path class="e" id="e3" d="M500 245 H580"></path>
        <path class="e" id="e4" d="M810 230 C850 230 850 95 890 95"></path>
        <path class="e" id="e5" d="M810 240 H890"></path>
        <path class="e" id="e6" d="M1005 130 V200"></path>
        <path class="e" id="e7" d="M1120 92 C1175 92 1175 375 1120 375"></path>
        <path class="e" id="e8" d="M695 340 V290"></path>
        <g class="nb">
          <rect x="20" y="180" width="170" height="70" rx="4"></rect>
          <text x="40" y="210">
            Your browser
          </text>
          <text class="sub" x="40" y="232">
            this page
          </text>
        </g>
        <g class="nb">
          <rect x="270" y="55" width="230" height="70" rx="4"></rect>
          <text x="290" y="85">
            Vercel, static pages
          </text>
          <text class="sub" x="290" y="107">
            prebuilt, no server
          </text>
        </g>
        <g class="nb key">
          <rect x="270" y="210" width="230" height="75" rx="4"></rect>
          <text x="290" y="240">
            portfo-api Worker
          </text>
          <text class="sub" x="290" y="262">
            contact · views · GitHub
          </text>
        </g>
        <g class="nb key">
          <rect x="580" y="205" width="230" height="85" rx="4"></rect>
          <text x="600" y="236">
            Cloudflare D1
          </text>
          <text class="sub" x="600" y="258">
            messages · views
          </text>
          <text class="sub" x="600" y="276">
            GitHub snapshot
          </text>
        </g>
        <g class="nb">
          <rect x="890" y="55" width="230" height="75" rx="4"></rect>
          <text x="910" y="85">
            Resend
          </text>
          <text class="sub" x="910" y="107">
            one email per message
          </text>
        </g>
        <g class="nb">
          <rect x="890" y="200" width="230" height="75" rx="4"></rect>
          <text x="910" y="230">
            portfo-chat Worker
          </text>
          <text class="sub" x="910" y="252">
            Workers AI · Vectorize
          </text>
        </g>
        <g class="nb">
          <rect x="890" y="345" width="230" height="60" rx="4"></rect>
          <text x="910" y="373">
            Email to Phu
          </text>
          <text class="sub" x="910" y="393">
            reply-to is the sender
          </text>
        </g>
        <g class="nb">
          <rect x="580" y="340" width="230" height="60" rx="4"></rect>
          <text x="600" y="368">
            Cron Trigger
          </text>
          <text class="sub" x="600" y="388">
            GitHub sync every 6 h
          </text>
        </g>
        <circle class="pk" r="4.5" data-pk="e2"></circle>
        <circle class="pk" r="4.5" data-pk="e3"></circle>
        <circle class="pk v" r="4.5" data-pk="e5"></circle>
        <circle class="pk" r="4.5" data-pk="e4"></circle>
        <circle class="pk" r="4.5" data-pk="e6"></circle>
        <circle class="pk v" r="4.5" data-pk="e8"></circle>
        <circle class="pk" r="4.5" data-pk="e7"></circle>
      </svg>
      <ol class="graph-m">
        <li>
          <b>Vercel</b>
          <span>Static pages only. The browser calls the Workers directly.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <b>portfo-api + D1</b>
          <span>
            Messages, views and GitHub data. Contact emails via Resend in the same request.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <b>Cron Trigger</b>
          <span>Pulls public GitHub activity every 6 hours into D1.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <b>portfo-chat</b>
          <span>
            A separate Worker answers with Llama 3.3 from a Vectorize index of my CV and case
            studies.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <b>Resend</b>
          <span>One email per contact submit; you wait for it, then get a confirmation.</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="how-notes">
      <p>
        <b>The chat</b> runs as its own Cloudflare Worker. It finds the closest passages in
        Vectorize, only answers from them, and lists its sources.
      </p>
      <p>
        <b>Your message</b> is validated, stored in D1, and emailed to me in the same request. A
        honeypot field catches simple bots. No captcha, no job queue and no LLM sorting.
      </p>
      <p>
        <b>Guardrails:</b> a honeypot on the form; about 10 chat messages per visitor every 10
        minutes and a daily AI budget on the chat Worker.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
